1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,864
November 19, 2026. The Madurai court. Just one day.

2
00:00:02,914 --> 00:00:06,750
From 4:40 in the evening to 4:40 the next evening.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,482
Within that one day, the police have to ask their questions.

4
00:00:09,532 --> 00:00:14,400
So far the police have said one thing about Meenakshi's role in the Tanishq heist.

5
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:17,678
Now the main accused denies it.

6
00:00:17,728 --> 00:00:20,350
In this video we will look at four things.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,782
One, where the case stands now. Two, how much jewellery has been recovered.

8
00:00:24,832 --> 00:00:29,396
Three, the contradiction between the police side and the accused's side.

9
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:31,824
Four, the questions that still have no answer.

10
00:00:31,875 --> 00:00:34,557
This is Part 3 of the Madurai Tanishq heist case.

11
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:35,650
Watch till the end.

12
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:52,244
This case is still under investigation. There is no verdict.

13
00:00:52,294 --> 00:00:55,566
Everyone in it is only an accused.

14
00:00:55,616 --> 00:00:59,185
I tell only what the police side said and what the news reported.

15
00:00:59,235 --> 00:01:02,211
In some places the reports differ, and I will say that too.

16
00:01:02,261 --> 00:01:06,245
If you have not seen the earlier two parts, the link is in the description.

17
00:01:06,295 --> 00:01:08,500
All pictures are illustrations.

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,792
A quick recap in two lines. November 12, 2026.

19
00:01:11,842 --> 00:01:16,089
A heist at the newly opened Tanishq store on the Madurai bypass road.

20
00:01:16,139 --> 00:01:23,714
At midnight on November 16, Nishanth was caught in Dharmapuri district, on a private bus going from Bengaluru to Salem.

21
00:01:23,764 --> 00:01:29,953
His father Suresh and the Instagram influencer Meenakshi had already been arrested.

22
00:01:30,003 --> 00:01:33,350
Now, what happened after that? Let us see.

23
00:01:33,849 --> 00:01:38,601
First, look at the numbers. Because the numbers kept changing in this case.

24
00:01:38,651 --> 00:01:43,215
The police now say 11.384 kg of gold and diamond jewellery was stolen.

25
00:01:43,265 --> 00:01:45,585
This is the figure given by the news agency ANI.

26
00:01:45,635 --> 00:01:52,506
On recovery: first, about five kg of jewellery was recovered when Nishanth's father Suresh and Meenakshi were arrested.

27
00:01:52,556 --> 00:02:03,231
Next, based on what Nishanth told investigators after his arrest, about 6.4 kg hidden at the foot of a hill near the Kapaleeswari Amman temple in Madakulam was recovered.

28
00:02:03,281 --> 00:02:09,279
One report says that adding five and 6.4, all the stolen jewellery is back.

29
00:02:09,329 --> 00:02:13,956
But I could not find that the police separately confirmed this as the final figure.

30
00:02:14,006 --> 00:02:16,699
So we should wait patiently for the final number.

31
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:19,851
Now, let us see what happened in court.

32
00:02:19,901 --> 00:02:27,296
On November 17, Nishanth was produced in court and remanded in judicial custody until December 1.

33
00:02:27,346 --> 00:02:32,040
Thursday, November 19. The police asked to question him further.

34
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:35,334
The court gave police custody for just one day.

35
00:02:35,384 --> 00:02:40,605
And with conditions. All the facilities he needs must be provided.

36
00:02:40,655 --> 00:02:44,097
His lawyer may meet him during the questioning.

37
00:02:44,147 --> 00:02:47,392
The lawyer for Nishanth's side is named Nishanth Periyarasu.

38
00:02:47,442 --> 00:02:50,949
He confirmed this to reporters.

39
00:02:51,449 --> 00:02:54,795
Now there is a contradiction in this case. Please pay attention.

40
00:02:54,845 --> 00:03:01,767
The police side, that is the early reports, said that Nishanth used Meenakshi's two-wheeler.

41
00:03:01,817 --> 00:03:04,798
That vehicle reportedly appeared in the CCTV footage of the heist.

42
00:03:04,848 --> 00:03:12,376
The police side also says the heist was planned for Meenakshi's need for money and a luxurious life.

43
00:03:12,426 --> 00:03:16,741
One report says they were building a house and had debts.

44
00:03:16,791 --> 00:03:19,591
But what did Nishanth say in the court compound?

45
00:03:19,641 --> 00:03:24,804
The news says he said Meenakshi has no connection with this heist.

46
00:03:24,854 --> 00:03:28,988
Now a question for you. Is the police right, or is he right?

47
00:03:29,038 --> 00:03:31,594
Only the court has to decide which is correct.

48
00:03:31,644 --> 00:03:35,838
But where do you think this contradiction will take the case?

49
00:03:35,888 --> 00:03:37,899
Tell me your guess in the comments.

50
00:03:38,399 --> 00:03:40,901
Here we must understand one thing clearly.

51
00:03:40,951 --> 00:03:43,964
A person may say this to protect a friend.

52
00:03:44,014 --> 00:03:47,140
Or what the police said may not be completely right.

53
00:03:47,190 --> 00:03:49,465
We have no evidence for either right now.

54
00:03:49,515 --> 00:03:51,733
That is the truth. One thing is certain.

55
00:03:51,783 --> 00:03:58,482
The court's job lies between the police's allegation and the accused's reply.

56
00:03:58,532 --> 00:04:02,621
Witnesses, CCTV, mobile phone records, and the records of the places where jewellery was recovered.

57
00:04:02,671 --> 00:04:04,549
The decision will come based on all this.

58
00:04:05,049 --> 00:04:07,856
There is one more interesting piece of information in the news.

59
00:04:07,906 --> 00:04:12,475
But this is only the police side's belief, not a confirmed fact.

60
00:04:12,525 --> 00:04:20,071
According to one report, the police believe the Netflix series Money Heist may have inspired the planning of this heist.

61
00:04:20,121 --> 00:04:30,281
Another report says Nishanth dropped out of college, edited videos for some YouTube channels, and often went on long bike trips.

62
00:04:30,331 --> 00:04:33,806
It also says Meenakshi and he were college classmates.

63
00:04:33,856 --> 00:04:39,275
I said in the last part that Meenakshi's Instagram followers increased after her arrest.

64
00:04:39,325 --> 00:04:45,899
This proves nothing. But it shows where people's attention goes when someone is accused.

65
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:49,869
Now let us quickly see where the case stands.

66
00:04:49,919 --> 00:04:53,585
Nishanth is in judicial custody until December 1.

67
00:04:53,635 --> 00:04:59,712
Right now, one day of police custody. Suresh and Meenakshi are both in judicial custody until November 29.

68
00:04:59,762 --> 00:05:06,687
The questions that still have no answer. One, what is Meenakshi's role, and whose version is correct, Nishanth's or the police's?

69
00:05:06,737 --> 00:05:10,793
Two, Suresh's role. Three, what is the final recovery figure?

70
00:05:10,843 --> 00:05:14,053
Four, when will the charge sheet be filed, and under which sections?

71
00:05:14,103 --> 00:05:17,638
Five, is anyone else involved besides these three?

72
00:05:17,688 --> 00:05:20,049
So far, no such news has appeared.

73
00:05:20,549 --> 00:05:22,276
One thing is clear in this case.

74
00:05:22,326 --> 00:05:28,179
Between what the police say and what the accused say, finding the truth is the court's job.

75
00:05:28,229 --> 00:05:31,000
Until then, everyone is only an accused.

76
00:05:31,050 --> 00:05:35,911
When you share a news item, check whether it is what the police said or something confirmed.

77
00:05:35,961 --> 00:05:40,874
Write your opinion in the comments. If you liked the video, like it and subscribe to the channel.

78
00:05:40,924 --> 00:05:43,486
If anything new comes out, I will tell you in the next part.

79
00:05:43,536 --> 00:05:43,799
Thank you.

